sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor U as User
participant B as Browser SPA
participant A as FastAPI /auth
participant D as PostgreSQL
U->>B: email + password
B->>A: POST /api/v1/auth/login
A->>D: load account + roles
A->>A: bcrypt verify + status + throttle
A->>D: insert refresh_session (hash)
A-->>B: access JWT + rotating refresh JWT
B->>A: GET /auth/me (Bearer)
A-->>B: account summary + roles
Note over A,D: Optional OAuth: /auth/oauth/{provider}/start -> callback -> /complete
